## 1. Executive Summary

LinkedIn AI is a multi-user AI personal-brand platform that helps users research professional topics, turn research into content opportunities, generate personalized LinkedIn posts, review quality, detect repetition, manage drafts, schedule content, publish through supported LinkedIn APIs, analyze available performance data, and improve future recommendations.

The product is intentionally more than a text generator. It should feel like:

> **“My AI content team for LinkedIn.”**

Core workflow:

```text
Google Login
    ↓
Personal Brand Profile
    ↓
Research
    ↓
Content Strategy
    ↓
AI Content Generation
    ↓
Quality Review
    ↓
Duplicate Detection
    ↓
Human Approval
    ↓
Scheduling
    ↓
LinkedIn Publishing
    ↓
Analytics
    ↓
AI Performance Analysis
    ↓
Learning
    ↓
Better Future Recommendations
```

The system must keep users in control of their account and published content and must never misrepresent mocked, unavailable, or unverified functionality as real.

