# 11. Quality Review and Duplicate Detection

## 11.1 AI Content Critic

Generated content should be evaluated before approval.

Possible dimensions:

- Hook quality
- Clarity
- Originality
- Value
- Readability
- Professional tone
- Personalization
- Repetition
- CTA quality
- Overall quality

AI quality scores must be explicitly distinguished from LinkedIn performance metrics.

## 11.2 Duplicate/Repetition Detection

Before publishing, compare new content with the user's previous content.

Detect:

- Exact duplicates
- Similar wording
- Similar hooks
- Similar topics
- Repeated ideas
- Excessive hashtag repetition

If content is too similar, warn the user and allow:

- Rewrite
- Change topic
- Continue anyway

