## 16.1 Publishing States

```text
Preparing
Ready
Publishing
Published
Failed
```

Publishing must use supported LinkedIn API functionality.

On successful publishing, store available:

- LinkedIn post ID
- User ID
- Draft ID
- Published timestamp
- Public/reference URL where available

On failure:

- Preserve the draft
- Show an understandable error
- Allow safe retry
- Never falsely mark the post as published

Only an actual successful API confirmation may produce `PUBLISHED`.

