# 33. Environment Configuration

Use:

```text
.env
.env.example
```

`.env` contains real local configuration and must not be committed.

`.env.example` contains placeholders only.

Configuration categories:

```text
Application secret
Google OAuth
LinkedIn OAuth
AI provider
Research provider
```

Typical OAuth variables:

```text
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI

LINKEDIN_CLIENT_ID
LINKEDIN_CLIENT_SECRET
LINKEDIN_REDIRECT_URI
```

Never print secret values.

AI/research mock mode may be configured without real external credentials. Exact variable names must match the implementation.

