# 34. Git and Dependency Safety

Required:

```text
.gitignore
README.md
.env.example
```

At minimum, ignore:

```text
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
logs/
temp/
secrets/
```

Before changing dependencies:

1. Inspect existing package/config files.
2. Check whether existing functionality already solves the problem.
3. Add a dependency only when genuinely justified.
4. Verify after the change.

Do not blindly regenerate lockfiles or upgrade unrelated packages.

